Package: autoagent
Version: 0.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AutoAgent Team <autoagent@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/autoagent/autoagent
Description: AI-powered coding agent CLI
 AutoAgent is an AI coding assistant that runs in your terminal.
 It provides intelligent code generation, refactoring, debugging,
 and file manipulation through natural language interaction.
 .
 Powered by a reverse-engineered Claude Code compatible engine
 with support for Anthropic, OpenAI, and DeepSeek APIs.
 .
 Features:
  - Interactive terminal UI
  - Non-interactive mode (-p/--print)
  - Multi-tool orchestration (Bash, Read, Write, Glob, Grep, etc.)
  - MCP server support
  - Session persistence and resumption
  - Plugin and skill system
